Subject: Tweak: blue Peach
Upstream-base: 7a6bf165d9f1c5914181c079c7d4bfa7204f3509

Peach has a second kit on the disc, blue with yellow: peach_alt.rlt, her
goalie's peachgoalie_alt.rlt and her six sidekicks' <sidekick>_peach_alt.rlt
textures. CharacterLoader dresses a captain in his alternate kit against a
captain of his colours (GetAlternateCaptain, NeedsAlternateColour), but no
other captain shares Peach's colour, so the retail game never shows it.

With "Blue Peach" enabled, Peach's team wears it on the field:
HasAlternateSwapTexture swaps Peach's and her goalie's kit for it, her
sidekicks load their _alt team textures, and the player indicators and the
defensive play overlay take its colour (Peach's alternate colour). The game
has no blue version of her menu pictures, Mega Strike hand, stadium banners
or crowd, so those stay pink. In a match of Peach against herself (Mirror
match) the away team wears the blue kit, as without the tweak.

